description:
We are proud to announce our Student Mauli Shah of 1st Year BID has been actively participating and winning in riffle shooting and secured the following positions
 14th position at 57th Gujarat state championship, Ahmedabad 2021 category: 10 m youth women;
164th position at all India G.V. Mavlanker Rifle Pistol , Ahmedabad, Gujarat 2021;
 1st  position at 6th Sayaji Kreeda Shooting Mahotsav,Vadodara 2022 &
 1st  position at 16th R.M Halwai shooting district shooting championship Vadodara 2022
